# Shell scripts must stay LF: they run inside Linux containers, where dash
# rejects `set -eu\r` with "Illegal option -". On Windows checkouts
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise convert them and break the image build.
# Discovered 2026-09-02: 26 scripts were CRLF and container/install-cli-tools.sh
# failed the agent image build. See nas/README.md defect #9.
*.sh text eol=lf
container/entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
